 r←Test_Misc_033(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;filename;before;res;rc;msg
⍝ Exercise `ProjectConfig` in read-only mode.
⍝ It used to add missing entries ("make", "tests") to the file although nothing was edited, and it
⍝ crashed on a file that was not valid JSON5 instead of displaying it.
⍝ Both cases print a warning to the session.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 filename←tempDir,'/cider.config'

 ⍝ Neither "make" nor "tests" defined: the file must not be changed
 (⊂'{ CIDER: { parent: "#", projectSpace: "Foo", source: "APLSource", dependencies: { tatin: "", nuget: "" }, dependencies_dev: { tatin: "" } }, SYSVARS: { io: 1, ml: 1 }, USER: { } }')⎕NPUT filename 1
 before←⊃⎕NGET filename
 res←##.Cider.ProjectConfig tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp before≢⊃⎕NGET filename
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'projectSpace'⍷∊res

 ⍝ Not valid JSON5: must be displayed anyway
 (⊂'{ CIDER: { parent: "#", ')⎕NPUT filename 1
 res←##.Cider.ProjectConfig tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'CIDER'⍷∊res

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
